@startuml testbed_activity
title Testbed Activity Diagram

start
 :Load testbed TOML -> TestbedConfig;
 :Expand cases (explicit + catalog);
 :Materialize child TOML files in _generated_configs;
 :Write plan / manifest / CSV / MD to output_root;

if (cfg.execute?) then (yes)
  :For each planned case;
  if (case.enabled?) then (yes)
    :Prepare AutoCaptureCollector (optional);
    :capture_start();
    :Run child workflow via provider
    (run_simulation / run_comparison / run_calibration);
    :capture_end();
    :Attach snapshot to summary as auto_capture;
    :Persist outputs (manifest, metrics CSV, report);
  else (no)
    :Mark case as disabled (skip execution);
  endif
else (no)
  :Only materialize child configs (no execution);
endif

stop

note right
 The Testbed orchestrates child workflows and collects
 results/metrics. The scientific work is performed by
 child workflows provided by the registered provider.
end note

@enduml
